1
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:42,880
Fu Mingyu's

2
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:44,440
actually got something.

3
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:46,440
I never thought my work

4
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:47,440
would be shown

5
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:48,080
like this.

6
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:51,320
No way?

7
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,759
You're impressed by him now?

8
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:54,120
Not at all.

9
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:56,120
He doesn't respect the creator.

10
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:56,680
That's

11
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:58,320
a dealbreaker for me.

12
00:01:58,520 --> 00:01:59,680
Good for you.

13
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:01,600
Don't think that guy

14
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:03,000
is all that talented or capable.

15
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:03,640
Let me tell you,

16
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,360
he's only working

17
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:05,680
so hard

18
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:06,560
because

19
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,600
he's into that female pilot.

20
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,080
Which one?

21
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,440
There are three here.

22
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:12,440
Definitely the young one.

23
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:13,440
He

24
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:14,720
might as well

25
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,400
have "I like Ruan Sixian"

26
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,400
tattooed on his forehead.

27
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:19,079
He's totally stealing my girl.

28
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,920
He likes Ruan Sixian?

29
00:02:23,079 --> 00:02:23,880
Why else?

30
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,800
Otherwise, I'd have already scored.

31
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:30,160
I sent over

32
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,960
this huge bouquet

33
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:32,480
that morning.

34
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:34,400
And then this guy cut in.

35
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:35,320
In the end,

36
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:36,480
Ruan Sixian didn't even see my flowers.

37
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:43,960
Honestly,

38
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,560
with a game like yours,

39
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:48,480
only this missed caller

40
00:02:48,720 --> 00:02:49,600
would ever fall for you.

41
00:02:58,920 --> 00:02:59,760
How about

42
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:01,520
doing me a favor?

43
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:02,720
No. No way.

44
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:04,920
You made your bed. You lie in it.

45
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:05,840
Come on,

46
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:07,840
help me get rid of her.

47
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:08,960
She's driving me crazy.

48
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,680
We're already broken up.

49
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,920
She keeps harassing me.

50
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:12,040
If she's harassing you,

51
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:13,840
go to the cops.

52
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:14,800
What's the point

53
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:15,600
of complaining to me?

54
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:17,720
That's not ideal.

55
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,320
We did truly love each other.

56
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,920
Taking it to court in the end...

57
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:22,079
Not good.

58
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:23,320
Just help me out.

59
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:24,480
I just want some peace and quiet.

60
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:26,200
Wouldn't have guessed it.

61
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:27,920
Mr. Yan, you're actually

62
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:29,320
such a sentimental guy.

63
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:30,520
You bet.

64
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,120
Come here.

65
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:31,880
Let me tell you what to do.

66
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:34,640
Just get on the wall.

67
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:35,720
Then

68
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:38,520
the whole world goes quiet.

69
00:03:39,079 --> 00:03:40,360
Not again?

70
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:41,120
Come on.

71
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,400
I can't do it.

72
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:46,440
What are you talking about?

73
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:46,880
Let's go!

74
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:16,240
Sis,

75
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:17,440
what's the plan?

76
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:18,560
Follow him.

77
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:22,440
Don't take it off.

78
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:23,680
Cameras everywhere.

79
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:24,360
Not wearing it!

80
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:26,000
With my looks,

81
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,880
wearing one makes me easier to spot.

82
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:32,960
Don't make any rash moves.

83
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:36,000
We need to think this...

84
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:37,600
Think this...

85
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,200
Through?

86
00:04:41,159 --> 00:04:42,520
Something feels off.

87
00:04:43,159 --> 00:04:44,720
Is he starting to remember something?

88
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,040
Otherwise why would he

89
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:46,960
carry my suitcase

90
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:48,280
and let me meet Captain Huang Ying?

91
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:49,400
Something fishy is going on.

92
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,440
Who is it?

93
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:04,520
Yan An?

94
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:07,320
What's he doing here this late?

95
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:18,720
Hi.

96
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:22,440
Mr. Yan.

97
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:23,880
What brings you here?

98
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:25,240
Why are you still calling me Mr. Yan?

99
00:05:25,960 --> 00:05:26,840
We know each other so well.

100
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:28,240
Just call me Yan An.

101
00:05:28,960 --> 00:05:30,080
Well... it's so late.

102
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:31,360
What are you doing here?

103
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:32,880
Nothing much.

104
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:33,920
I was on an overseas

105
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:34,920
business trip a few days ago.

106
00:05:35,080 --> 00:05:35,920
Just got back tonight.

107
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:37,680
Got you

108
00:05:39,159 --> 00:05:39,600
a little gift.

109
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:42,920
I called, but you didn't pick up.

110
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:44,159
I'm staying nearby

111
00:05:44,159 --> 00:05:44,800
tonight,

112
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:45,760
so I thought I'd drop it off.

113
00:05:46,400 --> 00:05:46,760
Well...

114
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:48,080
I can't accept it.

115
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:49,120
Why not?

116
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:49,640
It's cheap.

117
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:50,520
No...

118
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:52,040
No, no... with our relationship...

119
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:52,320
Wait...

120
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,159
- With our relationship,
- I really...

121
00:05:53,159 --> 00:05:53,880
you definitely can accept it.

122
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:54,840
Trust me. You really can.

123
00:05:54,840 --> 00:05:55,280
Just take it.

124
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:55,960
I really can't.

125
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:01,120
If you don't take it this time,

126
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:02,080
you're really not

127
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:03,000
doing me any favor.

128
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:03,600
No.

129
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:04,960
I really can't take this.

130
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:05,440
This...

131
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,520
Now you can take it, right?

132
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,320
If you feel bad about it,

133
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,320
just buy me dinner

134
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:12,200
the day after tomorrow.

135
00:06:12,880 --> 00:06:14,760
Then I'll take that as a yes.

136
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:15,880
Get some sleep!

137
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:16,800
Good night!

138
00:06:43,159 --> 00:06:43,680
What are you doing?

139
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:45,480
Can't you see he's already gone?

140
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:47,600
He didn't even get through the door.

141
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:48,960
Didn't you hear?

142
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,120
She said yes.

143
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:53,480
Yan An's definitely coming back.

144
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:55,400
No pro...

145
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:56,960
No proof...

146
00:06:57,840 --> 00:06:58,880
Just listen to me.

147
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,000
Remember

148
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:01,800
this door.

149
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:04,640
We'll wait here

150
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:06,560
and catch Yan An.

151
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,000
Why am I waiting by the door?

152
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:08,960
I'll take her on...

153
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:11,360
No rush.

154
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:12,600
What's the plan?

155
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:16,440
Wait!

156
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:17,440
Wait for what?

157
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:25,160
[Are you free tomorrow during the day?]

158
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:28,440
Busy.

159
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,720
[You're off both tomorrow and the day after.]

160
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:36,880
Can't I be busy on my days off?

161
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,920
I'm running, boxing,

162
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:41,640
doing practice tests, and sim training.

163
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,520
I need to get better at fighting.

164
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:47,080
So if

165
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:48,440
anyone ever lays a hand on me,

166
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:49,800
I can handle it myself

167
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:51,040
without calling the cops.

168
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:58,200
[Ruan Sixian, I'm saying this one last time.]

169
00:07:58,800 --> 00:07:59,920
[I didn't mean it today.]

170
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:02,920
Didn't mean it?

171
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,120
"Didn't mean it."

172
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:25,920
Hey, wake up.

173
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:27,760
You've been snoring

174
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:29,240
all night.

175
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,880
You wore out the sound-activated light.

176
00:08:31,960 --> 00:08:33,000
We can't just sit here and do nothing.

177
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:33,720
Let's go!

178
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:40,039
He didn't even go in.

179
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:41,080
Can't see from here.

180
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:42,120
Don't care about that.

181
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:42,559
He's not here,

182
00:08:42,559 --> 00:08:43,559
but that other woman is.

183
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,200
Let's take her on!

184
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:46,760
Relax.

185
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,520
Let's talk this through first...

186
00:08:48,640 --> 00:08:49,120
Talk about what?

187
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,800
We're here. What's there to talk about?

188
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:51,720
Who are they?

189
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,280
Mr. Yan?

190
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:54,640
Yan An, you there?

191
00:08:55,040 --> 00:08:55,840
Looking for Yan An?

192
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,040
Yan An?

193
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,160
Yan An, you there?

194
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,240
Yan An is not here...

195
00:09:05,400 --> 00:09:05,920
Yan An!

196
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:07,680
We're looking for Yan An.

197
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:08,640
Looking for Yan An?

198
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:10,200
This is my place!

199
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:11,960
Little homewrecker?

200
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:12,680
What are you doing?

201
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:14,320
I'm looking for Yan An.

202
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:15,120
He's not here.

203
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:15,760
This is my place.

204
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:16,840
Your place?

205
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:19,080
Yan An bought you this place, didn't he?

206
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:20,320
Like you deserve it?

207
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:21,720
You cheating scumbags!

208
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,400
I'm recording this!

209
00:09:22,880 --> 00:09:23,440
Yan An.

210
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:24,920
Yan An, get out here!

211
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:25,880
What are you doing in my room?

212
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:26,360
Yan An!

213
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:27,720
In the bed?

214
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:29,080
I'll call the cops if you keep this up.

215
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:29,560
Yan An!

216
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:30,600
I'm gonna hit you.

217
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:32,560
I'm serious.

218
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:33,200
In the closet?

219
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:33,840
Stop or not?

220
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,560
No hitting!

221
00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:37,400
This is a civilized society.

222
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,200
You broke into my place.

223
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,000
And you dare say...

224
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,680
Somebody's attacking me.

225
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:58,360
You're spraying me with a water bottle?

226
00:10:10,880 --> 00:10:12,200
And you say I broke in?

227
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:20,000
What's wrong?

228
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:21,440
What happened?

229
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,520
Nice one, you vixen.

230
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:25,640
Found another guy?

231
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:27,360
Using my boyfriend's money

232
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:28,480
to keep a toy boy?

233
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:29,840
And you hit people?

234
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:44,040
Alright.

235
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:44,920
You both have

236
00:10:44,920 --> 00:10:46,160
a clear understanding

237
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,000
of what just happened.

238
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:48,760
And no objections,

239
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:49,360
right?

240
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:50,520
In the future,

241
00:10:50,800 --> 00:10:52,000
always think twice

242
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,440
before you act.

243
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:54,360
Don't be so impulsive.

244
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:55,200
Don't just

245
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:55,720
barge into

246
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:56,720
someone's home

247
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:57,880
and cause a scene.

248
00:10:58,280 --> 00:10:59,000
In serious terms,

249
00:10:59,000 --> 00:10:59,840
this counts as disturbing the peace.

250
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,560
You should be grateful that Fu Mingyu

251
00:11:01,640 --> 00:11:02,600
isn't pressing charges.

252
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:05,320
Sorry for the trouble.

253
00:11:05,400 --> 00:11:06,040
It's my job.

254
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:06,920
Is there anything else

255
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:07,760
regarding my friend?

256
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:08,960
She's all clear here.

257
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:10,680
Just register at Window 3

258
00:11:10,760 --> 00:11:11,440
and you can leave.

259
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:12,320
Okay, thanks.

260
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:12,680
This way.

261
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,560
Officer, why?

262
00:11:14,680 --> 00:11:15,880
She ruined someone's marriage.

263
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:16,720
She can just sign

264
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:17,400
and leave?

265
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:18,960
Calm down first.

266
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:21,040
From what I know, you're not married.

267
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:22,240
Whose marriage did she ruin?

268
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,720
Then look at how she beat my brother.

269
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:24,680
He's all swollen up.

270
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,040
Why don't you ask your brother

271
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:26,800
who actually hit him?

272
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:27,320
If she didn't,

273
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,400
then I did?

274
00:11:28,400 --> 00:11:30,720
It... it was you.

275
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:31,400
No way!

276
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:32,080
When did I ever hit you?

277
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:32,840
Stop, stop!

278
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:33,720
Alright.

279
00:11:33,920 --> 00:11:34,360
You two,

280
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:35,320
come with me.

281
00:11:35,560 --> 00:11:35,880
Okay?

282
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:36,640
Over here.

283
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:37,400
Come... come on.

284
00:11:39,160 --> 00:11:39,920
Not feeling well?

285
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:41,240
No.

286
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:43,760
I didn't have breakfast.

287
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:45,920
It's an old issue.

288
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:47,640
You two can head back now.

289
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:49,080
Okay, thanks.

290
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:49,800
Thanks.

291
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:50,240
No problem.

292
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:55,680
So what happened today?

293
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:57,120
Yan An probably gave her

294
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:58,480
the cold shoulder before they broke up.

295
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:00,400
Didn't end things cleanly.

296
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:01,840
She's been staking the place out.

297
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:04,160
She saw Yan An come to my place last night,

298
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:06,160
so she came this morning looking for proof.

299
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:09,280
Actually, I warned you before

